Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:33:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: persist room delivery history without mixing native
 conversations

Store admitted message metadata with budget reservation and expose durable per-room receipts. Keep legacy metadata unknown, separate native conversation inspection, and verify restart recovery and room isolation without live agents.
